iew": 620, "last_played": 1778162736, "avatar": "66dad9d0a4ccdc4f4d8c34bc0f267af9cf6873c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great remaster of the original, it really is night and day with the way things work and how characters feel. Glad they ported aspects of ror2 into this as it really just adds more to the game as a whole, i really like the new minigames as a gives it new way to not only unlock abilities other than grinding or an hard to pull of challenge without command but adds fun side modes to the game to do as well. Looks wise this game is also great with the pixel art just looking pretty, music is great as with all risk of rain games. this is one of the first games i got with my new laptop and its been fun, also doesn't drain its battery like a poked water balloon so its got that going for it too. i'm just glad i finally got to play this and its overall lived up to my expectations if not exceeding them. i'd honestly recommend this to anyone new to risk of rain or people who somewhat enjoyed the first as this just improves on a lot of the weaknesses of the og. forgot to mention it but the online is nice, little dead rn but overall fun with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1775964555, "timestamp_updated": 1775964555, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}]}